# ca.Parse builds an authority from PEM already in memory. Production reaches
# a CA through LoadOrCreate (from disk) or AdoptPEM (rotation replacing the
# signer in place), so nothing in either binary calls it any more -- but it is
# how eighteen tests construct an authority without a temp directory, and the
# alternative is worse tests, not less code.
